Patches in this directory
=========================

The patch series under livekit-dsrpt/, livekit-verbatim/ and
livekit-verbatim-dsrpt/ modify LiveKit (https://github.com/livekit/livekit,
base commit 8d11efdfcd4220092b6ac7b8a21af28526da5a6b, v1.13.7).
The series under server-sdk-go/ modifies livekit/server-sdk-go v2.12.8
(https://github.com/livekit/server-sdk-go).

Both upstream projects are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(Copyright LiveKit, Inc.). These patches are derivative works of that code and
are distributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0; see ../../LICENSE
for the full text.

Authorship is recorded in each patch's From: header. In particular,
livekit-verbatim/0001 and livekit-verbatim-dsrpt/0001 are a cherry-pick of the
flag commit from upstream LiveKit PR #4812 and keep that PR author's
authorship; the remaining patches were written for this artifact.

The patches modify the upstream files as described in each patch's
commit message and diffstat.
